data: {"id": "a78ee413b84241ea-thinking-parallel_evidence-1049", "run_id": "a78ee413b84241ea", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 实体\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v11/workload`，UID `f99c513d-bc63-43ba-bc90-111cd5958ce7`，节点 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.26`\n- **容器**: `app`（镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`）\n\n### 已确认事实（支持候选原因）\n\n1. **状态确认为 CreateContainerConfigError**：kubectl describe、YAML、PromQL 三源一致——Pod 处于 `Pending` 阶段，容器 `app` 等待原因 `CreateContainerConfigError`，重启次数为 0，从未进入 Running。\n\n2. **根因明确：ConfigMap key 缺失**：\n   - **kubectl_events**：`Warning Failed` 33分钟前开始，重复 12 次，消息为 `Error: couldn't find key un", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789147400283, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

