data: {"id": "a78ee413b84241ea-final", "run_id": "a78ee413b84241ea", "seq": 1054, "ts_ms": 1789147417361, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v11/workload` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-v11/workload 中容器 app 引用的 ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input 中缺失 key 'unavailable-key'，导致 kubelet 无法挂载配置并持续抛出 CreateContainerConfigError。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `failed (x12 over 35m)` | `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input` | 确凿的上游原因证据，指出 ConfigMap 缺少必需键 `unavailable-key` |\n| 2 | K8s State | `kubelet` | `container.waiting_reason: CreateContainerConfigError` | 确认直接失败机制，由于配置挂载失败导致容器无法创建 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `Pod aiops-case-v11/workload` | `pod.phase: Pending`；`Ready: False (ContainersNotReady)` | 确认可见的用户现象，Pod 处于不可用状态且无重启 (restart_count: 0) |\n| 4 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (labels: `reason: CreateContainerConfigError`) | 独立观测印证了 Kubernetes 状态的等待原因与配置缺失直接相关 |\n\n**证据说明**：Kubernetes 事件（#1）明确指出了失败的根因（ConfigMap key 缺失），并直接触发了 #2 中的 `CreateContainerConfigError`。Prometheus 指标（#4）提供了独立的度量证据，其等待原因与 #2 的容器状态完全吻合。由于容器从未成功启动，Logging 与 Tracing 维度无业务日志产出，属正常现象，不构成证据缺失。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input 缺失 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 挂载配置失败 → 容器创建抛出 CreateContainerConfigError → Pod 持续处于 Pending / ContainersNotReady 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：**Pod 声明引用的 ConfigMap `aiops-case-v11/workload-input` 中缺少键 `unavailable-key`**。\n\n该缺失导致 kubelet 在挂载容器配置阶段受阻（证据 #1），从而抛出 `CreateContainerConfigError` 终止容器启动（证据 #2），最终表现为 Pod 长时间处于 `Pending` 且 `ContainersNotReady`（证据 #3、#4）。现有 Kubernetes 事实、事件与 Metrics 证据链闭合且互相印证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 57.7s\n├─ 问题定位: 12.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 37.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v11/workload: 37.2s (Evidence 28.0s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v11/workload**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 57.686, "metrics": {"run_id": "a78ee413b84241ea", "mttr": {"value": "57.7s", "seconds": 57.69287872314453, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 57692.87872314453, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 54124.90367889404, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7844.510316848755, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3257.744550704956}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 12696.065187454224, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 37173.624992370605, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7801.762819290161, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

